# Findings that were looked at and decided. One id per line, each with why.

# The image has no USER line because the entrypoint starts as root for one reason: to give /config and the catalog to PUID:PGID
# and drop to that user with setpriv. Every service runs as that user, never root (SECURITY.md). A USER line would make the
# volumes' ownership impossible to fix up; whoever wants no root at all runs the container with `user:` (compose) instead.
AVD-DS-0002
